+- Only managers may freeze a project (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`). Freezing
+  sets every member's role to `viewer`, managers included. Viewers cannot
+  write, so no task in a frozen project can change. Other projects are not
+  affected. Once frozen nobody is a manager, so a second freeze is 403. There
+  is no unfreeze endpoint.
+- Archived projects reject all writes, including freeze, with 409 (reads still work).
